# Graphify index scope for Ground Control (issue #1500, ADR-094).
#
# .gitignore is respected automatically; these patterns add build/vendor exclusions so the
# disposable index covers source, specs-as-code (docs/requirements), and docs — not generated,
# built, or vendored trees. Graphify output itself is never indexed or committed.
graphify-out/
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
.tools/
frontend/dist/
frontend/coverage/
**/*.class
